  "releaseNotes": "Version 2 removes the obsolete nested proxy details and fraud score.\n\n      Features:\n      - Dependency injection setup through AddLegioRadar(options)\n      - Typed HttpClient-based IP lookup client\n      - Optional X-Client-ID and X-API-Key authentication headers\n      - Configurable retry settings for transient transport and service failures\n      - In-memory caching for successful lookup results\n      - Fluent result model with success/error helpers\n      - Proxy detection through IsProxy and classification verdicts\n      - Public enums and constants for lookup classifications, errors, and network types",
